description         emulator for Azure Blob, Queue and Table storage
long_description    Azurite is Microsoft's local emulator for Azure Storage. \
                    It serves the Blob, Queue and Table service APIs, for \
                    developing and testing code that uses Azure Storage \
                    without an Azure account.

homepage            https://github.com/Azure/Azurite

